    "abstract": "Illustrated parts figure for the audio management unit rack installation and the associated flight interphone control panels, showing the solid and the perforated mounting tray standards.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the audio management unit mounting tray, the rack guide, the retaining hardware and the flight interphone control panels in the flight compartment rack.",
      "figure_note": "The figure is drawn for the upper rack position; the lower position uses the same items with a different guide. The perforated mounting tray is not interchangeable with the solid tray because the retaining screw length differs at the thinner flange, and fitting the long screw into the perforated tray will bottom on the rack rail."
    },
